## PHẦN 1: CONTEXT SYNC ENGINE

### 1.1 Auto-Discovery Sources

| Source | Location | Count | Auto-Sync |
|--------|----------|-------|-----------|
| Rules | `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` | 84 | Yes |
| Skills | `.cursor/skills/*/SKILL.md` | 17 | Yes |
| Knowledge | `.cursor/knowledge/**/*` | 100+ | Yes |
| MCP Servers | `mcps/*/SERVER_METADATA.json` | 5 | Yes |
| Dependencies | `.cursor/scripts/skill-dependencies.json` | Auto | Yes |

### 1.2 Sync Pipeline

```yaml
sync_pipeline:
  enabled: true
  cache_ttl: 3600  # 1 hour
  
  stages:
    - name: "Rules Sync"
      source: ".cursor/rules/*.mdc"
      action: "Load all .mdc files, extract tags, index by category"
      
    - name: "Skills Sync"
      source: ".cursor/skills/*/SKILL.md"
      action: "Load SKILL.md, extract keywords, gates, dependencies"
      
    - name: "Knowledge Sync"
      source: ".cursor/knowledge/**/*"
      action: "Index all knowledge files for semantic search"
      
    - name: "MCP Sync"
      source: "mcps/*/SERVER_METADATA.json"
      action: "Load MCP server metadata, check availability"
      
    - name: "Dependency Sync"
      source: ".cursor/scripts/skill-dependencies.json"
      action: "Parse dependency manifest, cache package states"
```

