## PHẦN 2: LANGUAGE DETECTION

### 2.1 Supported Languages

| Code | Language | Native Name | Detection Method |
|------|----------|-------------|-----------------|
| vi | Vietnamese | Tiếng Việt | Keyword + Pattern matching |
| zh | Chinese | 中文 | CJK character detection |
| ja | Japanese | 日本語 | Hiragana/Katakana detection |
| ko | Korean | 한국어 | Hangul character detection |
| en | English | English | Default fallback |

### 2.2 Detection Algorithm

```
INPUT: "Tạo một landing page đẹp cho startup AI"
OUTPUT: {
  language: "vietnamese",
  confidence: 0.92,
  scores: {
    vietnamese: 8,
    english: 3,
    chinese: 0,
    japanese: 0,
    korean: 0
  }
}
```

