## PHẦN 4: TASK DECOMPOSITION

### 4.1 Task Manifest Schema

```yaml
task_manifest:
  version: "1.0.0"
  generated_at: "ISO-8601 timestamp"
  request_id: "UUID v4"
  
  input:
    original_request: "string"
    detected_language: "vi|en|zh|ja|ko"
    translated_request: "string"
    primary_intent: "build|redesign|fix|review|explain|security"
    primary_domain: "string"
    
  analysis:
    skills_selected:
      - skill_id: "string"
        confidence: 0.0-1.0
        role: "primary|secondary|mandatory|overlay"
        
    rules_matched:
      - rule_id: "string"
        
    gates_required:
      pre: ["gate-1", "gate-2"]
      post: ["gate-3", "gate-4"]
      
    dependencies:
      python: ["pkg1", "pkg2"]
      npm: ["pkg1", "pkg2"]
      system: ["tesseract", "docker"]
      
  tasks:
    - task_id: "task-1"
      task_name: "string"
      task_type: "pre-gate|implementation|post-gate|delivery"
      description: "string"
      estimated_time: "string"
      skills_applied: ["skill1", "skill2"]
      subtasks:
        - subtask_id: "sub-1"
          name: "string"
          checkpoints: ["check1", "check2"]
      dependencies: ["task-id"]
      status: "pending|in_progress|completed|failed"
```

### 4.2 Gate Checkpoint Library

#### Pre-Review Gates

```yaml
karpathy_pre:
  name: "Karpathy Pre-Review Gate"
  checkpoints:
    - "State Assumptions"
    - "Simplicity Check"
    - "Surgical Scope Defined"
    - "Goals Defined"

taste_pre:
  name: "Frontend Taste Pre-Review Gate"
  checkpoints:
    - "Brief Inference (Page kind, Vibe, Audience)"
    - "Design Read Declaration"
    - "Anti-Default Discipline Applied"
    - "Dial Values Set (VARIANCE/MOTION/DENSITY)"

fulloutput_pre:
  name: "Full Output Pre-Review Gate"
  checkpoints:
    - "Scope Locked"
    - "Deliverable Count Confirmed"
    - "Dependencies Identified"

review_pre:
  name: "Frontend Review Pre-Review Gate"
  checkpoints:
    - "Scope Analysis Complete"
    - "Quality Plan Defined"
    - "Files to Touch Listed"

security_pre:
  name: "Security Review Pre-Review Gate"
  checkpoints:
    - "Threat Modeling Complete"
    - "Security Requirements Defined"
    - "Attack Surface Documented"
```

