## PHẦN 6: EXECUTION ENGINE

### 6.1 Execution Modes

| Mode | Description | Use Case |
|------|-------------|----------|
| Sequential | Tasks run one after another | Default for most tasks |
| Parallel | Independent tasks run concurrently | Multiple independent sections |
| Gated | Tasks wait for gate approval | Security-sensitive operations |

### 6.2 Gate Verification Flow

```
TASK EXECUTION
     │
     ▼
┌─────────────────┐
│ Run Pre-Gates  │ ← All gates must PASS
└────────┬────────┘
         │ PASS
         ▼
┌─────────────────┐
│ Implement Task  │
└────────┬────────┘
         │
         ▼
┌─────────────────┐
│ Run Post-Gates  │ ← All gates must PASS
└────────┬────────┘
         │ PASS
         ▼
    NEXT TASK
```

### 6.3 Gate Pass Criteria

| Gate Type | Pass Criteria |
|------------|---------------|
| karpathy-pre | All K.1-K.4 checkpoints PASS |
| taste-pre | All 0.A-0.F checkpoints PASS |
| fulloutput-pre | Scope locked, deliverables counted |
| review-pre | Scope analyzed, quality plan defined |
| security-pre | Threat model, security requirements defined |
| karpathy-post | All K.5-K.7 checkpoints PASS |
| taste-post | All 6.A-6.H checkpoints PASS |
| fulloutput-post | No truncation patterns, complete code |
| review-post | All B.1-B.7 sections PASS |
| security-post | All Security-1-9 layers PASS |

