### 7.3 Python API

```python
from task_analyzer import TaskAnalyzer

# Create analyzer
analyzer = TaskAnalyzer(dependencies_path="skill-dependencies.json")

# Analyze request
manifest = analyzer.analyze("Tạo landing page đẹp cho startup AI")

# Access results
print(f"Detected: {manifest.input['detected_language']}")
print(f"Primary Intent: {manifest.input['primary_intent']}")
print(f"Skills: {[s['skill_id'] for s in manifest.analysis['skills_selected']]}")
print(f"Tasks: {len(manifest.tasks)}")

# Export to JSON
json_output = analyzer.to_json(manifest)
```

