### 10.2 Skill Decision Tree

```
IS REQUEST ABOUT...
│
├─► PAYMENT? (MoMo, SePay, PayOS, VNPay, ZaloPay, VietQR)
│   └─► vietnam-payment-review + security-review + full-output
│
├─► SECURITY? (vulnerability, pentest, CVE, OWASP)
│   └─► security-review + karpathy-coding
│
├─► FRONTEND? (UI, landing, redesign, component)
│   ├─► REDESIGN? → frontend-redesign + full-output + frontend-review
│   ├─► BUILD? → frontend-taste + full-output + frontend-review
│   └─► REVIEW? → frontend-review (standalone)
│
├─► KNOWLEDGE? (RAG, wiki, FAQ, weknora)
│   └─► weknora-kb + karpathy-coding
│
├─► OCR? (text extraction, image to text)
│   └─► document-ocr + karpathy-coding
│
└─► DEFAULT?
    └─► karpathy-coding (overlay)
```

### 10.3 Gate Checklist

**Pre-Review (Before Code):**
- [ ] karpathy-coding: Assumptions stated, Simplicity checked, Scope defined, Goals set
- [ ] frontend-taste: Design read declared, Anti-default applied, Dials set
- [ ] full-output: Scope locked, Deliverables counted
- [ ] frontend-review: Scope analyzed, Quality plan defined
- [ ] security-review: Threat model, Security requirements defined

**Post-Review (After Code):**
- [ ] karpathy-coding: Surgical changes, Simplicity maintained, Goals met
- [ ] frontend-taste: Layout, Typography, Animation, Assets verified
- [ ] full-output: No skeletons, No TODOs, Complete code
- [ ] frontend-review: Correctness, Design, A11y, Performance verified
- [ ] security-review: Auth, Validation, Data protection, Crypto verified

